Files changed from Herdr's spaces mod:
  mods/herdr-folders/main.js   Changed: rows drawn as a folder tree, no
                               "This computer" header, a New folder button,
                               machine folding kept in the folder tree, drag
                               and drop through the tree, Folders' own space
                               menu with color swatches, the v0.1.14 and
                               v0.1.15 rail, git lookups and machine login
                               guidance fitted to the tree.
  mods/herdr-folders/mod.json  Changed: the title is "Folders" and
                               `cloned_from` (spaces 0.1.15) was added.

Files with code from Herdr's "menu" mod, version 0.1.15 (defaults/mods/menu,
Apache License 2.0):
  mods/herdr-folders/menu.js   The space menu's items, their icons, the key
                               hint and the arrow keys, changed: the items
                               are objects, and a folder's items are added.
  mods/herdr-folders/folders.js  The popup item rows are drawn as Herdr's menu
                               draws them; the rest of the file is original
                               (MIT).

Files added, original to herdr-folders (MIT):
